  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRCSDK 3.3.0, timeout for uploading contents are only 30 seconds.\n\nPlease extend the timeout period for uploading contents.\n\nBecause of short timeout period, contents creators with low-speed internet users cannot update contents with VRCSDK 3.3.0.\n\nSome user has low speed internet around 1Mbps for upload speed.\n\n(It's not rare to have much lower speed in download so most users with 1Mbps upload have more speed for downloading, at least in Japan.)\n\nUnder 1Mbps connection, with 30 seconds, we can only upload 3.75Mbytes.\n\nMany avatars and almost all worlds are more than 3.75Mbytes, so I think this is too short.\n\n(As far as I know, in VRCSDK 3.2.0, we can spend more than 10 min to upload contents.)",
